WEBVTT

00:00:00.400 --> 00:00:03.498
Hi, I'm Ryomi Lenscroft.

00:00:03.648 --> 00:00:13.850
I help with finding solid research. I help you find real studies, plan action research in your class, and make sense of survey results.

00:00:14.000 --> 00:00:19.786
For example, ask me: find studies on feedback that actually works.
